  "content": "[Intro]\n[C]\n[Am]\n[C]\n[Am]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C]Every night I\nhope and pray\n[Am]A dream lover will\ncome my way\n[C]A girl to hold\nin my arms\n[Am]And know the magic\nof her charms 'Cause I\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]want A\n[G7]girl To\n[C]call My\n[F]own I want a\n[C]dream [Am]lover So\n[Dm7]I don't have to [G7sus4]dream [G7]alone\n[C]\n[G7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C]Dream lover,\nwhere are you\n[Am]With a love,\noh, so true\n[C]And the hand that\nI can hold\n[Am]To feel you near as\nI grow old 'Cause I\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]want A\n[G7]girl To\n[C]call My\n[F]own I want a\n[C]dream [Am]lover So\n[Dm7]I don't have to [G7sus4]dream [G7]alone\n[C]\n[C7]\n\n[Interlude]\n[F]Someday, I\ndon't know how\n[C]I hope she'll\nhear my plea\n[D7]Some way, I\ndon't know how\n[G7]She'll bring her\nlove to me\n\n[Verse 3]\n[C]Dream lover,\nuntil then\n[Am]I'll go to sleep and\ndream again\n[C]That's the only\nthing to do\n[Am]Till all my lover's\ndreams come true 'Cause I\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]want\n[G7]A girl\n[C]To call My\n[F]own I want a\n[C]dream [Am]lover So\n[Dm7]I don't have to [G7sus4]dream [G7]alone\n[C]\n[G#7]\n\n[Verse 4]\n[C#]Dream lover,\nuntil then\n[A#m]I'll go to sleep\nand dream again\n[C#]That's the only\nthing to do\n[A#m]Till all my lover's\ndreams come true 'Cause I\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#]want A\n[G#7]girl To\n[C#]call My\n[F#]own I want a\n[C#]dream [A#m]lover So\n[D#m7]I don't have to [C#sus4]dream [G#7]alone\n[C#]\n[A#m]Please don't make me\n\n[Outro]\n[C#]dream alone\n[A#m]I beg you don't make me\n[C#]dream alone\n[A#m]No, I don't wanna\n[C#]dream alone\n[A#m]",
